
Administration commands:

@admin <player>      Toggle <player>'s admin access status.
@make <#>            Puts an instance of the item in your inventory.
@itemlist            Displays items numbers for use with @make.
@credits <#>         Adds # of credits to your total.
@cost <#>            Print credit cost for advancing a skill from level (#)
                     to (# + 1).
@heal                Heals you fully.
@bomb                Clears (almost) all items from current room.
@max                 Set all stats to 25.
@setclaim <player>   Give <player> a claim flag.
@armour              Toggles armour.  When on, all attacks on you miss and
                     all explosions do 0 damage.
@peace               Stops all computer players in the current room from
                     attacking.
@dump                Shows coordinates and room numbers of exits in the
                     current room.
@map                 Shows a 3x3 map of room numbers centered on your
                     current room in the xy-plane.
@announce <message>  Fake an ANNOUNCEMENT:.

@toggle ladder       Place/remove a ladder in the current room, etc.
        medical
        sleep
        dark
        recycle
        store
        nofloor
        reactor

@goto <#>            Transports you to the specified room number.
